   "fix": "State the general form first: `theorem integral_dual_sq_stdGaussian (L : StrongDual \u211d E) : \u222b x, L x ^ 2 \u2202(stdGaussian E) = \u2016L\u2016 ^ 2`, proved by `variance_of_integral_eq_zero (by fun_prop) (integral_strongDual_stdGaussian L) \u25b8 variance_dual_stdGaussian L` (the first two lines already in the proof, minus `innerSL_apply_norm`). Derive `integral_inner_sq_stdGaussian v` from it at `innerSL \u211d v` via `innerSL_apply_norm` and `real_inner_comm`, and have `integral_norm_sq_stdGaussian` call the dual version at `innerSL \u211d (b i)` directly.",
